### Health
GET http://localhost:5000/health

### App Status
GET http://localhost:5000/api/status

### AI Symptom Checker
POST http://localhost:5000/api/health-checks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "demo-user",
  "symptoms": "I have fever, cough, and body ache for 2 days",
  "age": 28,
  "sex": "male",
  "location": "Dhaka"
}

### Emergency Detection
POST http://localhost:5000/api/health-checks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "demo-user",
  "symptoms": "আমার বুক ব্যথা এবং শ্বাস নিতে কষ্ট হচ্ছে",
  "age": 52,
  "sex": "female",
  "location": "Chattogram"
}

### Medical Chat
POST http://localhost:5000/api/chats
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "demo-user",
  "message": "What should I do for mild acidity after dinner?"
}

### Report Analyzer
POST http://localhost:5000/api/reports/analyze
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "demo-user",
  "reportText": "Hemoglobin 10.2 g/dL, WBC 7200, Platelet 250000, Fasting blood glucose 7.2 mmol/L"
}

### History
GET http://localhost:5000/api/health-checks?userId=demo-user

### Chat History
GET http://localhost:5000/api/chats?userId=demo-user

### Report History
GET http://localhost:5000/api/reports?userId=demo-user

### Get Profile
GET http://localhost:5000/api/users/profile/demo-user

### Save Profile
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/users/profile/demo-user
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Demo Patient",
  "email": "demo@example.com",
  "age": 34,
  "gender": "female",
  "district": "Dhaka",
  "bloodGroup": "B+",
  "knownConditions": ["asthma"]
}

### Role Dashboard (requires Firebase ID token in production)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/users/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{firebase_id_token}}

### Admin: List Users
GET http://localhost:5000/api/users/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{firebase_id_token}}

### Admin: Assign Doctor Role and Patient Access
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/users/admin/users/doctor-user-id/access
Authorization: Bearer {{firebase_id_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role": "doctor",
  "status": "active",
  "assignedPatientIds": ["patient-user-id"]
}

### Guardian: Add Child Profile
POST http://localhost:5000/api/users/guardian/children
Authorization: Bearer {{firebase_id_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Demo Child",
  "age": 7,
  "bloodGroup": "O+",
  "knownConditions": ["asthma"],
  "relationship": "Mother"
}

### Doctor: Save Clinical Note or Prescription
POST http://localhost:5000/api/clinical-notes
Authorization: Bearer {{firebase_id_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientId": "patient-user-id",
  "type": "prescription",
  "title": "Follow-up prescription",
  "content": "Doctor-entered prescription and follow-up guidance."
}

### Doctor/Patient/Guardian: List Clinical Notes
GET http://localhost:5000/api/clinical-notes?patientId=patient-user-id
Authorization: Bearer {{firebase_id_token}}
